{"meta":{"id":"tt2872518","type":"movie","name":"La cabaña","imdb_id":"tt2872518","description":"Después de sufrir una tragedia familiar, Mack Phillips cae en una profunda depresión que le lleva a cuestionar todas sus creencias. Sumido en una crisis de fe, recibe una enigmática carta donde un misterioso personaje le cita en una cabaña abandonada en lo más profundo de los bosques de Oregón. A pesar de sus dudas, Mack viaja a la cabaña, donde se encontrará con alguien inesperado. Este encuentro conducirá a Mack a enfrentarse a importantes verdades, que no sólo transformarán su comprensión de la tragedia sino que harán que su vida cambie para siempre.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt2872518.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bAup7FGUlmNVOuhZFlLgmDPo0Eg.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kksP9C3CQ39oPn8Ncl9bimQt3fb.png","genres":["Drama","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2017","released":"2017-03-02T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"132 min","imdbRating":"6.3","country":"Canada, Hong Kong, United States of America","cast":["Sam Worthington","Octavia Spencer","Tim McGraw","אביב אלוש","すみれ","Radha Mitchell","Graham Greene","Gage Munroe","Megan Charpentier","Lane Edwards","Alice Braga","Ryan Robbins","Emily Holmes","Amélie Eve","Jordyn Ashley Olson","Laura MacKillop","Derek Hamilton","Tanya Hubbard","Carson Reaume","David MacKay","Chris Britton","Kendall Cross","Jay Brazeau","Greta Makena Gibson","David Longworth","Ty Olsson","Leena Manro","Kayla Fielding","Grace Netter","Nicholas Holmes"],"director":["Stuart Hazeldine"],"writer":["John Fusco","William Paul Young","Andrew Lanham","Destin Daniel Cretton","Wayne Jacobsen","Brad Cummings"],"trailers":[{"source":"Ouc9W0GRlQw","type":"Trailer","name":"The Shack (2017 Movie) Official Trailer – ‘Keep Your Eyes On Me’","ytId":"Ouc9W0GRlQw","lang":"en"},{"source":"CL0yUbSS5Eg","type":"Trailer","name":"The Shack (2017 Movie) Official Trailer –